        "TileImage": "$($repository 3ee70c86-8407-44bd-9927-3002d265a3a2).Image",
        "Description": "47, we have a problem, A few days ago, a high operative of  ICA lost his all 2 TB of hentai collection from laptop and was blackmailed by few messages on the phone - &quot;we publish that into press, give us 50 000 dollars, one helicopter and few coins from 47s pocket - they sounds pretty good when falling &quot;. We identified that Rebecca Carlisle and her group of &quot;Little Oil Drinkers&quot; involved in that operation. We cant let it go so easy, 47. Eliminate all 4 members of &quot;Little Oil Drinkers&quot;",
